# The 1939 scenario as the Axis side, written by hand: the orders of a turn with choices other than
# the first, which the enter-* scripts take. In September 1939: two moves and a Cancel; COMMANDS
# Fortify, Join, Detach, Supply, Rotate, Army Drill and Static; the navy sailed; the air force against
# a navy out of range and to a new base. In October: Tech twice, the second time without the money.
# Then END TURN every month to the end, the Hall of Fame, and Quit. Not here: Paratroop (no wait
# comes after it; not looked into).
#! seed 1939
#! cfg side=2

# Waits that any key ends.
rule 1 key space

# The title menu: Start NEW Game. Start Year: 1939.
play until 2:W
text s
play until 2:S
key enter

# Moves: the second army of the From menu (Hannover) to the second city of its To menu.
play until 2:M
digest
text m
prompt
key down
prompt
key enter
prompt
key down
prompt
digest
key enter
# Moves: the first army (Berlin) to the first city.
play until 2:M
text m
prompt
key enter
prompt
key enter

# COMMANDS, Cancel: the Cancel menu lists both moves; cancel the first (Berlin).
play until 2:M
text c
prompt
text c
prompt
digest
key enter
# Back at COMMANDS: Fortify the first city (Berlin).
prompt
text f
prompt
digest
key enter
# Join: no two armies in one city.
prompt
text j
# Detach: from the first city of the From menu.
prompt
digest
text d
prompt
digest
key enter
# Supply: every army has supplies.
prompt
text s
# Rotate: the Flip Stack menu, the stack the detach made; its first army to the top.
prompt
text r
prompt
digest
key enter
prompt
digest
key enter
# Army Drill: the first city, then the first army of the Which menu.
prompt
text a
prompt
digest
key enter
prompt
digest
key enter
# Static, the last entry (PgDn): a menu with NONE in it; Esc.
prompt
key pagedown
prompt
key enter
prompt
digest
key esc
# Esc: back to the main menu (at the main menu itself, Esc shows it again).
prompt
key esc

# Navy: Sail, and the first city of its To menu.
play until 2:M
digest
text n
play until 2
digest
text s
play until 2:T
digest
key enter

# Air Force: Navy Atk (the Allied navy is out of range, and the Planes menu comes back), then
# AirBase and the first city of its menu. A Planes menu after that: Esc.
play until 2:M
digest
text a
play until 2:P
digest
text n
play until 2:P
digest
text a
play until 2:A
digest
key enter
rule 2:P key esc

# END TURN to October 1939 (Fortify used the money September had).
rule 2:R key enter
rule 2:E text y
play until 2:M
digest
text e

# October 1939. Tech: the first technology, then again with too little money left; then Esc.
play until 2:M
text t
prompt
digest
key enter
prompt
key enter
prompt
digest
key esc

# END TURN every month to the end.
rule 2:M text e
play until 4
text Tester
key enter
prompt
digest
key space
prompt
digest
key space

# Back at the title menu: Quit, and a key for END's "Press any key to continue".
play until 2:W
digest
text q
repeat space
